+| --- | --- |
+| class_type | IdealPDActuator |
+| joint_names_expr | rear_wheel_joint |
+| stiffness | 0.0; controller Kp |
+| damping | 0.2 N m s/rad; nominal controller Kd |
+| effort_limit | 6.28 N m; explicit post-controller effort clamp |
+| effort_limit_sim | 6.28 N m; retained simulator setting |
+| velocity_limit | 61.6 rad/s; stored model parameter |
+| velocity_limit_sim | 61.6 rad/s; solver speed constraint |
+| friction | 0.106 N m; provisional static threshold |
+| dynamic_friction | 0.106 N m; fitted moving-friction setting |
+| viscous_friction | 0.0 N m s/rad; passive model setting |
+| armature | None; no explicit override, not a claim of zero joint/motor inertia |
